  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;be a differentiable function defined on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;such&nbsp;that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "27",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math>.</p><p>Differentiating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p>",
